     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Summary, attribution and selection of ideas",
     "texto": [
      "A good summary keeps the question, the main finding and a relevant limitation. It leaves out secondary details and rephrases faithfully; it does not add a conclusion the report does not support.",
      "To attribute results you can use **raport wskazuje, że…** («the report indicates that…») and **nie zbadano…** («… was not studied»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
